\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"66.7\" width=\"320\" height=\"23.599999999999994\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,38.1 9.1,31.0 14.2,27.0 19.3,26.2 24.5,19.9 29.6,22.3 34.7,19.9 39.8,22.3 44.9,19.9 50.0,21.5 55.1,23.9 60.3,28.6 65.4,25.4 70.5,22.3 75.6,20.7 80.7,21.5 85.8,12.8 91.0,29.4 96.1,34.9 101.2,34.2 106.3,31.0 111.4,36.5 116.5,38.9 121.6,42.9 126.8,57.1 131.9,59.5 137.0,46.8 142.1,54.8 147.2,55.6 152.3,60.3 157.4,62.7 162.6,61.1 167.7,70.5 172.8,66.7 177.9,65.1 183.0,65.9 188.1,66.3 193.2,65.7 198.4,66.5 203.5,65.4 208.6,65.1 213.7,66.7 218.8,65.4 223.9,65.1 229.0,62.7 234.2,65.1 239.3,72.2 244.4,79.6 249.5,74.6 254.6,75.7 259.7,77.3 264.9,77.0 270.0,97.2 275.1,93.6 280.2,88.8 285.3,92.2 290.4,94.4 295.5,94.4 300.7,93.6 305.8,93.3 310.9,95.7 316.0,95.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 50.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 50.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 50.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 50.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 126.8 69.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 167.7 82.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 183.0 77.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 213.7 78.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" 